---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---

<section class='introduction'>
  <div class='introduction__section'>
    <div class='introduction__description'>
      <h1>Florencia Nieto</h1>
      <h2>Interior designer</h2>
    </div>
    <div class='introduction__img'>
      <Image
        src='https://res.cloudinary.com/dgxp6vwij/image/upload/v1728453288/Profile%20photo/rgi01ovrmmljqpoykdd9.webp'
        alt='Florencia Nieto portrait'
        width={400}
        height={526}
        layout='constrained'
        sizes='(max-width: 768px) 250px, 400px'
        loading='eager'
        decoding='async'
        fetchpriority='high'
      />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class='description'>
    <div class='description__text'>
      <p>
        Florencia is an interior designer based in Auckland, bringing an international perspective
        shaped by her experience in Argentina.
      </p><p>
        Educated and trained in her hometown, Florencia developed her design foundation through
        formal studies in interior design, complemented by a Master of Applied Management undertaken
        in New Zealand, strengthening her ability to manage projects holistically - from concept
        through to execution - working closely with clients, suppliers, and trades. Her experience
        includes working on projects within landmark developments designed by internationally
        renowned architect César Pelli.
      </p><p>
        Before establishing her interior design practice, Florencia founded and led two creative
        businesses across design and events, developing a strong foundation in aesthetics, client
        experience, and project execution. This multidisciplinary background continues to inform her
        approach today, allowing her to design spaces that are both visually compelling and
        thoughtfully resolved.
      </p><p>
        Her work is characterised by a strong editorial eye, creating layered, curated interiors
        that feel personal, refined, and deeply livable.
      </p><p>
        Alongside her design practice, Florencia is also the co-founder of Linger Creative, a
        pottery and design brand focused on unique, handcrafted pieces that reflect her interest in
        materiality and tactile design.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class='qualifications' aria-label='Qualifications'>
      <span>Diploma of Interior Design (DID)</span>
      <span>Master of Applied Management (MAM)</span>
    </div>

    <div class='description__action'>
      <a href='/projects' class='custom-link download'>See all projects</a>

      <a
        href='https://drive.google.com/uc?export=download&id=13hw8dIRo7hxUo23nut1KzEa4HJAh9Y-3'
        class='custom-link download'
        download='Florencia Nieto Portfolio'
      >
        Portfolio
        <svg
          xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'
          width='20'
          height='20'
          fill='black'
          viewBox='0 0 24 24'
        >
          <path
            d='M12 16a1 1 0 0 0 1-1V6a1 1 0 1 0-2 0v9a1 1 0 0 0 1 1zM16.707 11.293a1 1 0 0 0-1.414 0L13 13.586V7a1 1 0 0 0-2 0v6.586l-2.293-2.293a1 1 0 0 0-1.414 1.414l4 4a1 1 0 0 0 1.414 0l4-4a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.414zM5 17a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v2a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-2a1 1 0 1 0-2 0v2H6v-2a1 1 0 0 0-1-1z'
          ></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  .introduction {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    margin: 0 8rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .introduction__section {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .introduction__description h1 {
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .introduction__description h2 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .introduction__img {
  }

  .introduction img {
    height: 526px;
    border-top-left-radius: 40%;
    overflow: hidden;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center bottom;
  }

  .description__text {
    text-align: justify;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .qualifications {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0.35rem;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.72);
    font-size: 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-right: auto;
    padding-top: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .description__action {
    display: flex;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-top: 3rem;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }
  .download {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .introduction {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      margin: 0;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .introduction__section {
      flex-flow: column-reverse;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .introduction__description {
      flex: 1;
      order: 2;
    }

    .introduction__img {
      flex: 1;
      order: 2;
    }

    .introduction__title {
      flex: 1;
      order: 3;
    }

    .introduction img {
      width: 250px;
      height: 336px;
    }

    .introduction__description h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .introduction__description h2 {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
    }

    .qualifications {
      gap: 0.5rem;
      font-size: 0.5rem;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }
  }
</style>
